{#
---
name: igmp-snooping
summary: Enable immediate-leave for IGMP and MLD snooping on all VLANs
config_style: junos
section: top_level_set_delete
roles: [all]
category: misc
status: active
requires:
  vars: [aos_version, role]
---
Apstra 5.0.0 and later place snooping under the evpn-1 routing instance on leaf
and access devices; every other combination configures it at the top level.
-#}
{% if aos_version >= '5.0.0' and role in ['leaf', 'access'] %}
set routing-instances evpn-1 protocols igmp-snooping vlan all immediate-leave
set routing-instances evpn-1 protocols mld-snooping vlan all immediate-leave
{% else %}
set protocols igmp-snooping vlan all immediate-leave
set protocols mld-snooping vlan all immediate-leave
{% endif %}
